{"about_the_game":"<strong>Nimbit Frontier</strong> is a cozy creature-collecting life sim where you raise adorable little Nimbits, build custom habitats, and explore the shifting Underwild for fragments and rare species. Hatch, care for, and release your Nimbits to distant Sanctuaries, all while upgrading your tools, helping townsfolk, and discovering new secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/b190e3efc3793ca3eda333f839ad7441.poster.avif?t=1772581374\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/b190e3efc3793ca3eda333f839ad7441.webm?t=1772581374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/6dd663d34bf0b1ae01b1b84161a2d995.poster.avif?t=1772581374\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/6dd663d34bf0b1ae01b1b84161a2d995.webm?t=1772581374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/229103fd16127ae58f65f912f1d7ee29.poster.avif?t=1772581374\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2477710/extras/229103fd16127ae58f65f912f1d7ee29.webm?t=1772581374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam